# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# env files — never commit. See .env.example for the key names.
.env*
!.env.example

# Wikipedia images smoke_test.py caches between runs. Created on first
# `make inference-smoke`; safe to delete, never worth committing.
inference/.testimages/

# The labelled eval set, and the raw score matrix a sweep produces from it.
#
# Same reasoning as .testimages/, at twenty times the size: ~470 regenerable Wikipedia
# photos across 20 tags is tens of megabytes of binary that `fetch_demo_eval.py` rebuilds
# on demand. calibration.json is deliberately NOT ignored — that one is small, is the
# artifact `dooh apply-calibration` reads, and is meant to be reviewable in a diff.
#
# Real creatives dropped in here to replace the demo set are ignored for a second reason:
# they are advertiser material and do not belong in a git history.
inference/eval/
inference/sweep.json

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# runtime logs
*.log
docs
